{"3965270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Jazzgame", "steam_appid": 3965270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4774880], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Jazzgame</strong> is an open-world action adventure where fluid parkour and free-flow combat collide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour and Free running<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965270/extras/e81682ac2ebc48f70d7317d31748222b.poster.avif?t=1781564840\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965270/extras/e81682ac2ebc48f70d7317d31748222b.webm?t=1781564840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint across towering rooftops, vault through alleyways, and chain acrobatic movement into bone-crunching combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REACTIVE SATISFYLING RAGDOLLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965270/extras/68d83bf1d6a7ccd260a3afa2b0f0eb4d.poster.avif?t=1781564840\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965270/extras/68d83bf1d6a7ccd260a3afa2b0f0eb4d.webm?t=1781564840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > On the streets below, rival gangs rule with violence but you fight back with momentum, style, and sheer skill. Whether you’re outmaneuvering enemies with seamless freerunning or diving headfirst into brutal brawls, every fight and every rooftop is a stage for your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MIX PARKOUR WITH COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965270/extras/4f99c00cea4b3dcc434c9e1cb646106d.poster.avif?t=1781564840\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965270/extras/4f99c00cea4b3dcc434c9e1cb646106d.webm?t=1781564840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Fluid Parkour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Flow Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless Dynamic Open World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive Dynamic NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Depth Character Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive Ragdolls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour Tricks</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Jazzgame</strong> is an open-world action adventure where fluid parkour and free-flow combat collide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour and Free running<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965270/extras/e81682ac2ebc48f70d7317d31748222b.poster.avif?t=1781564840\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965270/extras/e81682ac2ebc48f70d7317d31748222b.webm?t=1781564840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint across towering rooftops, vault through alleyways, and chain acrobatic movement into bone-crunching combo